    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Allez, ram\xE8ne-moi les 3 \xE9toiles cach\xE9es sur Igara!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Piti\xE9, fais en sorte que j'ai pas travaill\xE9 mon level design pour rien..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[3]'
      value: Ils avaient peur de ce qu'ils pourraient y trouver.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[4]'
      value: "Ils \xE9taient terrifi\xE9s."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[5]'
      value: "Ils se sont donc mis \xE0 inventer  des chansons pour penser \xE0 autre chose."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[0]'
      value: ' '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[1]'
      value: Hey! That's me, Noam!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[2]'
      value: (The game dev)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[3]'
      value: (I also made the Game Design, Level Design, most of the...) Anyway!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[4]'
      value: Ha! Ha! I'm a robot in the game!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[5]'
      value: If you can get the 3 secret stars of this planet...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[6]'
      value: I'll give you a goood information, how about that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
